      <profiles>
        <profile name="Dark Ritual" id="5af9-12a3-f5bd-7ddb" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">You can: Once per battle per unit, during the Command phase, in your turn, if the unit contains 1+ CULT DEMAGOGUE models, until the end of the turn:
  -&gt; The unit is eligible to declare a charge even if it Advanced this turn.
  -&gt; The unit gets +1 to Hit rolls.
  -&gt; The unit gets +1 to Wound rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Faithful Flock" id="1da5-7751-d6e4-a262" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While this model is leading a unit, if the unit contains 1+ CULT DEMAGOGUE models, the unit has a 5+ invulnerable save.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Leader" id="72b8-56b1-df2a-2c79" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
