        <profile name="Fortification" id="e914-cd6b-501b-1aa3" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">During the Shooting phase, the attacking unit gets -1 to Hit rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Malevolent Locus (Aura)" id="bc1b-1259-225d-e396" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While a friendly HERETIC ASTARTES unit is within 9" of this model, improve that unit's Leadership characteristic by 1.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Malign Cover" id="a49f-52e5-edab-69c8" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When a ranged attack is allocated, unless the target is not fully visible to the attacking model because of this model, that unit has the Benefit of Cover.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="06d2-74fa-5301-0007" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
