        <profile name="Daemonic Ordnance" id="dcf6-1ce9-76a5-8c92" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is selected to shoot, you may use this ability, until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by this model gain [DEVASTATING WOUNDS] and [HAZARDOUS].</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="be4e-aac8-386c-b2d5" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Damaged" id="6727-0967-0b90-ed55" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While the model has X or fewer wounds remaining, X being its rating, this model gets -1 to Hit rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
