        <profile name="Dark Ascension (Aura)" id="00b5-2d67-0810-eba6" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time a friendly unit makes a Dark Pact (the triggering unit must have HERETIC ASTARTES) within 6" of this model, until the end of the phase, the number of selections of the triggering unit's Dark Pacts ability is 2.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="3877-a421-7970-0baf" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Devoted to Destruction" id="14d1-1fda-5889-d472" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">If this model is equipped with one weapon named "Close combat weapon", if this model is equipped with exactly 2 melee weapons other than "Close combat weapon", improve the Attacks characteristic of melee weapons other than "Close combat weapon" equipped by this model by 2.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
