          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">For the rest of the battle:
  -&gt; At the start of the battle, if the unit is in Strategic Reserves: the unit can be set up on the battlefield from Strategic Reserves in the Reinforcements step of your first, second or third Movement phase, ignoring any limits on units in Strategic Reserves.
  -&gt; While this model is not on the battlefield, the unit can be set up on the battlefield from Strategic Reserves, treating the battle round as 1 higher than it is.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
