        <profile name="Supreme Commander" id="8375-be6d-65eb-cf71" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While this model is friendly, the unit must be your Warlord.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Warmaster" id="f075-23a4-a080-279d" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">During the Command phase, in your turn, until the start of your next Command phase:
  Select exactly 1 distinct options (Warmaster Ability):
    - While a friendly HERETIC ASTARTES unit (excluding DAMNED units) is within 6" of this model, you can re-roll the Hit roll for attacks made by that unit.
    - While a friendly HERETIC ASTARTES unit with the INFANTRY or MOUNTED keyword (excluding DAMNED units) is within 6" of this model, that unit has a 4+ invulnerable save.
    - While a friendly HERETIC ASTARTES unit (excluding DAMNED units) is within 6" of this model, you can re-roll the Leadership roll for that unit; you can re-roll the Battle-shock roll for that unit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Paragon of Hatred" id="a9c8-14b0-e88d-7e5c" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">During the Command phase, in your turn, until the start of your next Command phase, while a friendly HERETIC ASTARTES unit (excluding DAMNED units) is within 6" of this model, you can re-roll the Hit roll for attacks made by that unit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Mark of Chaos Ascendant" id="b33d-67a7-04c5-4c68" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">During the Command phase, in your turn, until the start of your next Command phase, while a friendly HERETIC ASTARTES unit with the INFANTRY or MOUNTED keyword (excluding DAMNED units) is within 6" of this model, that unit has a 4+ invulnerable save.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Lord of the Traitor Legions" id="0a0a-3e32-28e0-31ef" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
