    <selectionEntry name="Fabius Bile" id="cd9c-96e7-6dcb-bedf" hidden="false" import="true" type="unit">
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="a404-c25f-013a-7e55" field="selections" includeChildForces="true" includeChildSelections="true" scope="roster" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Chirurgeon" id="5320-5d2a-434b-a17a" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the end of each phase, if this model was destroyed this phase (1+ times), the first time this battle per model:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 2+, this model can be set up on the battlefield as close as possible to where it was destroyed more than 1" away from all enemy models; this model regains all its lost wounds.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Enhanced Warriors" id="f05d-1d96-451b-d32d" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of the battle, if the unit is an attached unit, for the rest of the battle:
  For each friendly Bodyguard model in the unit:
    -&gt; Add 1 to the Strength characteristic of melee weapons equipped by that model.
    -&gt; Add 1 to that model's Toughness characteristic.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Leader" id="328c-0e17-3847-a0bf" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit gains the Leader ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Surgeon Acolyte" id="c8fa-8e12-1565-e9ae" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">You can: Once per turn per unit, if the unit has the FABIUS BILE keyword, each time an attack is allocated to the unit, change the Damage of that attack to 0.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Feel No Pain" id="6223-2b04-0eb8-3736" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit has the Feel No Pain X+ ability, X being its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
