          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="3327-7683-3b06-fe30" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Plough Through the Enemy" id="a694-c521-f704-bd34" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">After this model resolves its attacks, during the Fight phase, if this model has destroyed 1+ enemy units this phase:
  For each enemy unit within 6" of this model: The unit must take a Battle-shock test.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Damaged" id="2620-6adc-3a8c-7de2" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While the model has X or fewer wounds remaining, X being its rating, this model gets -1 to Hit rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Damaged Objective Control" id="6367-3908-4b3c-766e" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While the model is Damaged, subtract its rating from this model's Objective Control characteristic.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
