    <selectionEntry name="Detachment" id="e296-4a38-d9a5-289c" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="f2ab-f65b-d165-591e" field="selections" includeChildForces="true" includeChildSelections="true" scope="roster" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
        <constraint id="6fef-88f8-ddfb-306d" field="selections" includeChildForces="true" includeChildSelections="true" scope="roster" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
      </constraints>
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink name="Configuration" id="d856-31a6-fa30-c697" hidden="false" primary="true" targetId="4ac9-fd30-1e3d-b249"/>
      </categoryLinks>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup name="Detachment" id="1131-ccf0-b2bc-7df4" hidden="false">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="4f75-925b-5585-2a1c" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
          </constraints>
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry name="Huron's Marauders" id="44d2-04f0-309d-575e" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="aa0f-16ac-2815-6495" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Tyrannical Motivation" id="bd78-40ee-ffbf-2ea5" hidden="false">
                  <description>During the Command phase, in your turn:
  -&gt; Until the start of your next Command phase:
    Select exactly 1 distinct options:
      - All friendly HERETIC ASTARTES INFANTRY units get +1 to Hit rolls.
      - All friendly HERETIC ASTARTES INFANTRY units are eligible to shoot in a turn in which they Fell Back; all friendly HERETIC ASTARTES INFANTRY units are eligible to declare a charge in a turn in which they Fell Back.
-&gt; At the start of each phase:
  For each friendly HERETIC ASTARTES INFANTRY unit: While the unit is visible to a friendly HURON BLACKHEART model, until the end of the phase: the unit gets +1 to Hit rolls; the unit is eligible to shoot in a turn in which it Fell Back; the unit is eligible to declare a charge in a turn in which it Fell Back.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Disruption" id="83b6-f2bb-5a42-807f" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="ecf8-cf72-7d5b-1b5b"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="3"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Cabal of Chaos" id="9e8b-efe2-7ff2-6b36" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="baf7-d2c5-6b7a-dc54" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Empyric Wellspring" id="036c-277c-ec89-9ce5" hidden="false">
                  <description>While the unit is performing a Dark Pact, until the end of the phase:
  -&gt; When a friendly unit is selected to shoot (the triggering unit must have HERETIC ASTARTES and PSYKER) (the triggering unit must not have DAEMON): during the Shooting phase, in your turn, improve the Strength characteristic of ranged weapons equipped by the triggering unit by 1.
  -&gt; When a friendly unit is selected to fight (the triggering unit must have HERETIC ASTARTES) (the triggering unit must have DAEMON PRINCE or DAEMON PRINCE WITH WINGS) (the triggering unit must not have KHORNE), if the unit is performing a Dark Pact:
    -&gt; During the Fight phase, improve the Strength characteristic of melee weapons equipped by the triggering unit by 2.
    -&gt; Improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of melee weapons equipped by the triggering unit by 1.
Applies to: units with HERETIC ASTARTES (excluding KHORNE).</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Disruption" id="b66b-bc3d-1824-a8a4" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="ecf8-cf72-7d5b-1b5b"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="1"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Renegade Raiders" id="b906-aa42-9cd9-c6f2" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="0326-694d-ca72-f3f4" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Raiders and Reavers" id="f769-0e6a-770c-753c" hidden="false">
                  <description>Ranged weapons equipped by all friendly HERETIC ASTARTES models gain [ASSAULT].
While the target is within range of an objective marker, improve all friendly HERETIC ASTARTES models' Armour Penetration characteristic by 1.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Priority Assets" id="f486-a890-95cd-2d7c" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="0936-9767-1cc7-52ae"/>
