              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="3"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Fellhammer Siege-host" id="89a5-170b-1bf3-7016" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="971f-3d04-7db7-77f4" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Iron Fortitude" id="be81-d9d0-cd0c-9703" hidden="false">
                  <description>When the unit targets a friendly HERETIC ASTARTES unit (excluding DAMNED units), when the attack's S is more than the target's T, the unit gets -1 to Wound rolls.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Take and Hold" id="131e-da8a-d51a-f0fc" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="1cc1-f11a-4e8f-1bcc"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="2"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Deceptors" id="4972-a08d-9d88-5f7a" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="e22f-fb7b-a34f-c022" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Masters of Misdirection" id="68c5-ac65-9694-e1b5" hidden="false">
                  <description>For the rest of the battle:
  -&gt; If the unit has the LEGIONARIES or CULTIST MOB keywords, the unit gains the Infiltrators ability.
  -&gt; While this model is leading a unit, unless the unit has the EPIC HEROES keyword, the unit gains the Infiltrators ability.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Disruption" id="9bad-173b-43d8-a6f9" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="ecf8-cf72-7d5b-1b5b"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="2"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Soulforged Warpack" id="a523-e0fe-4e1c-bc70" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="1eb6-034b-5168-1675" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Debt to the Soul Forge" id="15f5-0cd2-e264-6abe" hidden="false">
                  <description>Each time a friendly unit makes a Dark Pact (the triggering unit must have DAEMON, HERETIC ASTARTES and VEHICLE), you may use this ability, until the end of the phase:
  -&gt; The triggering unit gets -1 to Leadership rolls.
  -&gt; While making ranged attacks, the triggering unit gets +1 to Wound rolls.
  -&gt; Add 2 to the Attacks characteristic of melee weapons equipped by the triggering unit.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Take and Hold" id="89c4-c4f4-116c-6ac6" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="1cc1-f11a-4e8f-1bcc"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="2"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Renegade Warband" id="2cf4-ac9c-5417-10ac" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="0171-314e-ae9f-25b1" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Slaves to None" id="618c-25b8-c11e-f1c1" hidden="false">
                  <description>If the unit has the HERETIC ASTARTES keyword:
  -&gt; The unit loses the Dark Pacts ability.
  -&gt; Ranged weapons equipped by all friendly units gain [ASSAULT].</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Priority Assets" id="a599-9348-9276-d71c" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="0936-9767-1cc7-52ae"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="2"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Dread Talons" id="d11c-e4a9-32c7-b761" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="3349-49ac-c5d3-c53b" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Terror Descends (Aura)" id="48ba-ce2f-d920-3cdc" hidden="false">
                  <description>-&gt; At the start of the Battle Shock step in your opponent's turn:
  For each enemy unit: While the unit is below its starting strength, while the unit is within 12" of a friendly HERETIC ASTARTES unit, the unit must take a Battle-shock test.
-&gt; When an enemy unit takes a Battle-shock test: while the triggering unit is within 12" of a friendly HERETIC ASTARTES unit, the triggering unit gets -1 to Battle-shock rolls; the triggering unit does not need to take any further Battle-shock tests this phase.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Disruption" id="a6f7-e294-e7cb-2bd6" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="ecf8-cf72-7d5b-1b5b"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="2"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Chaos Cult" id="6cec-4da4-a89d-fb98" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="c941-763e-2ac4-ff2b" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Desperate Devotion" id="a286-677a-3e87-1d08" hidden="false">
                  <description>If the unit has the DAMNED keyword, until the end of the phase, if the unit has the DAMNED keyword, add 2 to the unit's Move characteristic; the unit gets +2 to Charge rolls.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Priority Assets" id="4f6a-2b16-8dbb-51b0" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="0936-9767-1cc7-52ae"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="2"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Veterans of the Long War" id="a5ea-d708-db75-226c" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="d6c0-bb13-7c78-3fe9" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Focus of Hatred" id="6788-9aef-80d7-d5bc" hidden="false">
                  <description>At the start of your Command phase, until the start of your next Command phase:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit:
    -&gt; That unit is marked as focus of hatred.
    -&gt; While the unit is tagged focus of hatred, you can re-roll the Hit roll for attacks made by all friendly HERETIC ASTARTES models (excluding DAMNED models).</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Take and Hold" id="43e1-3f6f-1589-7ec6" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="1cc1-f11a-4e8f-1bcc"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="2"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Nightmare Hunt" id="f96f-5896-93c2-fc05" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="bd2c-6f10-7fe5-8af3" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Terror Made Manifest" id="ad17-2596-4649-5559" hidden="false">
                  <description>-&gt; At the start of the Battle Shock step in your opponent's turn:
  For each enemy unit: While the unit is below its starting strength, while the unit is within 12" of a friendly HERETIC ASTARTES unit, the unit must take a Battle-shock test, applying -1 to that test; the unit does not need to take any further Battle-shock tests this phase.
While the target unit is below half strength, all friendly HERETIC ASTARTES models get +1 to Hit rolls.
Against HERETIC ASTARTES targets, while the attacking unit is Battle-shocked, the attacking unit gets -1 to Hit rolls.
While the target is Battle-shocked, all friendly HERETIC ASTARTES models get +1 to Wound rolls.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Disruption" id="3119-b711-52d9-dec1" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="ecf8-cf72-7d5b-1b5b"/>
                <categoryLink name="Detachment Tag: nightmare" id="fbf2-34c2-8fa1-cccd" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="995c-86ac-5dfc-dc65"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="2"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Pactbound Zealots" id="53dd-68f7-7c1f-3e5d" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="9703-3e50-99bf-5893" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Marks of Chaos" id="c8c6-8d1f-27a0-635e" hidden="false">
                  <description>Each time the unit makes a Dark Pact, until the end of the phase:
  -&gt; If the unit has the KHORNE keyword, if a dark pact roll was a success this phase, while making attacks made with [LETHAL HITS] weapons, the unit scores Critical Hits on Hit rolls of 5+ with melee weapons.
  -&gt; If the unit has the TZEENTCH keyword, if a dark pact roll was a success this phase, while making attacks made with [LETHAL HITS] weapons, the unit scores Critical Hits on Hit rolls of 5+ with ranged weapons.
  -&gt; If the unit has the NURGLE keyword, if a dark pact roll was a success this phase, while making attacks made with [SUSTAINED HITS 1] weapons, the unit scores Critical Hits on Hit rolls of 5+ with ranged weapons.
  -&gt; If the unit has the SLAANESH keyword, if a dark pact roll was a success this phase, while making attacks made with [SUSTAINED HITS 1] weapons, the unit scores Critical Hits on Hit rolls of 5+ with melee weapons.
  -&gt; If the unit has the CHAOS UNDIVIDED keyword, if a dark pact roll was a success this phase, while making attacks made with [LETHAL HITS] weapons or if a dark pact roll was a success this phase, while making attacks made with [SUSTAINED HITS 1] weapons, you can re-roll a Hit roll of 1.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Disruption" id="8fdf-362f-b066-7191" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="ecf8-cf72-7d5b-1b5b"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="3"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Creations of Bile" id="1c30-e099-1aca-8708" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="41ef-a3af-61a7-b33f" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Experimental Augmentations" id="201e-cec3-3832-b5a5" hidden="false">
                  <description>-&gt; At the start of the battle, for the rest of the battle:
  -&gt; Select one:
    - Cholinergic Accelerants: add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of melee weapons equipped by all friendly HERETIC ASTARTES INFANTRY models (excluding DAMNED models).
    - Hyperadrenal Infusion: add 2 to all friendly HERETIC ASTARTES INFANTRY models (excluding DAMNED models)'s Move characteristic.
    - Paraneural Reactions: improve the Weapon Skill characteristic of melee weapons equipped by all friendly HERETIC ASTARTES INFANTRY models (excluding DAMNED models) by 1.
    - Supracutaneous Chitination: improve all friendly HERETIC ASTARTES INFANTRY models (excluding DAMNED models)'s Toughness characteristic by 1.
    - Macrotensile Sinews: add 1 to the Strength characteristic of melee weapons equipped by all friendly HERETIC ASTARTES INFANTRY models (excluding DAMNED models).
    - Ophthalmic Enhancement: improve the Ballistic Skill characteristic of ranged weapons equipped by all friendly HERETIC ASTARTES INFANTRY models (excluding DAMNED models) by 1.
  -&gt; Or, instead of selecting, roll two D6: each result applies the option it numbers (1 Cholinergic Accelerants, 2 Hyperadrenal Infusion, 3 Paraneural Reactions, 4 Supracutaneous Chitination, 5 Macrotensile Sinews, 6 Ophthalmic Enhancement); a result already active has no additional effect.
-&gt; When you use Experimental Augmentations, you may use this ability: if your army includes a FABIUS BILE model that is the Warlord, you can re-roll the Experimental Augmentations roll.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Take and Hold" id="17b5-6592-97d9-a131" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="1cc1-f11a-4e8f-1bcc"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="3"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Devotees of Destruction" id="c6ca-bde2-8304-c97c" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="d9cc-9932-dab1-6120" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Rain of Ruin" id="b0a4-d325-92ed-bf25" hidden="false">
                  <description>Ranged weapons equipped by all friendly units with the HAVOCS or OBLITERATORS keyword gain [HEAVY].
Applies to: units with HERETIC ASTARTES.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Priority Assets" id="760a-39c9-2e44-4e19" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="0936-9767-1cc7-52ae"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="1"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Murdertalon Raiders" id="a914-9458-c5f8-0bbc" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="c7f9-7631-af52-774a" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Prey on the Weak" id="40ef-e144-30be-05c4" hidden="false">
                  <description>For the rest of the battle:
  -&gt; While the target is Battle-shocked or while the target unit is below half strength, you can re-roll a Hit roll of 1 for attacks made by all friendly units.
  -&gt; While the attacking unit is Battle-shocked or while the attacking unit is below half strength, each time an attack targets the unit, apply -1 to the Hit roll.
Applies to: units with HERETIC ASTARTES, INFANTRY, FLY.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Reconnaissance" id="5f05-52bc-979f-8bb1" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="b4a7-5083-fe94-4d24"/>
                <categoryLink name="Detachment Tag: nightmare" id="7dbb-cc03-c2e0-dcd3" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="995c-86ac-5dfc-dc65"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="1"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Warpstrike Champions" id="d545-85a4-65d6-2f59" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="178f-0f06-7c1e-51c4" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Warp Portals" id="f50f-1df7-6de9-df77" hidden="false">
                  <description>At the end of your opponent's turn, you may use this ability:
  -&gt; Select up to 1/2/3 friendly HERETIC ASTARTES units with the MUTILATORS, OBLITERATORS or TERMINATOR keyword (Incursion/Strike Force/Onslaught) if the selected unit is unengaged: that unit can be placed into Strategic Reserves.
Applies to: units with HERETIC ASTARTES.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Disruption" id="bf6a-9c09-7c77-75e3" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="ecf8-cf72-7d5b-1b5b"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
