  <sharedRules>
    <rule name="Dark Pacts" id="ae8f-a598-b4d3-c749" hidden="false">
      <description>When the unit is selected to shoot, you may use this ability or when the unit is selected to fight, you may use this ability, if your Army Faction is CHAOS SPACE MARINES, while the triggering unit has the Dark Pacts ability, until the end of the phase:
  -&gt; The unit must take a Leadership test.
  -&gt; If the triggering leadership roll was a failure, the triggering unit suffers D3 mortal wounds.
  Select one of the following:
    - The triggering unit's weapons gain [LETHAL HITS].
    - The triggering unit's weapons gain [SUSTAINED HITS 1].</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Cults of the Dark Gods" id="9efe-45a1-aa81-2355" hidden="false">
      <description>You can: If your Army Faction is CHAOS SPACE MARINES:
  -&gt; Your army can include friendly units with the KHORNE BERZERKERS, NOISE MARINES, PLAGUE MARINES or RUBRIC MARINES keyword.
  -&gt; All friendly units with the KHORNE BERZERKERS, NOISE MARINES, PLAGUE MARINES or RUBRIC MARINES keyword gain the HERETIC ASTARTES keyword, replacing their WORLD EATERS, THOUSAND SONS, DEATH GUARD and EMPEROR'S CHILDREN keywords.
  -&gt; Your army can include at most 250/500/750 (Incursion/Strike Force/Onslaught) points of friendly units with the KHORNE BERZERKERS, NOISE MARINES, PLAGUE MARINES or RUBRIC MARINES keyword.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
</catalogue>
